   "preheader": "One live class. One time. Tomorrow at 11 AM Central.",
   "body": "{{first_name}},\n\nTomorrow is my birthday.\n\nAnd I'm the one giving the gift.\n\nMy dad taught me something about cars. A sudden noise is usually a cheap fix. But a tick that gets louder for months? That one costs you.\n\nHigh blood pressure is that tick. So is creeping blood sugar. So are hormone changes nobody explains.\n\nMost of us get a pill for each noise. Nobody opens the hood.\n\nSo tomorrow, for my birthday, my wife Annie and I are teaching one free live class:\n\n**The #1 Thing Your Doctor Never Checks**\n\nFriday, September 18. 11 AM Central / 12 PM Eastern. For men and women.\n\nThis is the #1 unlock you need. It's the only time we are doing this masterclass.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE MY FREE SEAT → bpquiz.com/birthday]\n\nJoel Polley, RN\n\nP.S. Always work alongside your doctor. This class helps you find better questions to bring them."
