   "preheader": "Live at 11 AM Central. One time only.",
   "body": "{{first_name}},\n\nToday I turn another year older.\n\nHere's the gift I want to give you.\n\nYears ago, I worked nights. Lots of caffeine to stay awake. Eating all through the night. My blood pressure climbed, early. My father and grandfather both died young.\n\nI could have blamed my genes and waited my turn.\n\nBut I went looking underneath.\n\nAnd a few right changes later, my blood pressure came down while I was still working nights.\n\nWhat I found is the #1 thing underneath chronic illness. That's my birthday gift to you, and I'm revealing it live at 11.\n\nPlus, a surprise giveaway for everyone on the live call.\n\n**The #1 Thing Your Doctor Never Checks**\nToday. 11 AM Central / 12 PM Eastern. Annie and I, live.\n\nThis is the only time we are doing this masterclass.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE MY SEAT FOR 11 AM → bpquiz.com/birthday]\n\nJoel Polley, RN\n\nP.S. Want to make my birthday? Hit reply with \"I'll be there.\"\n\n<small>Giveaway: no purchase necessary. Must be on the live call to win.</small>"
