   "slot": "Sun 9/20 · 9:00 AM CT",
   "subject": "nobody looked at his back",
   "preheader": "The question that should come before the next prescription.",
   "body": "{{first_name}},\n\nThere's a story I tell about a man with terrible back pain.\n\nHe got pain pills. The pain came back. Stronger pills. Then stronger.\n\nNobody asked why his back hurt.\n\nHe had a knife in his back.\n\nPull the knife out, and the body can do what God designed it to do.\n\nI tell that story because I lived the other side of it. As a nurse, I handed out thousands of pills. For years, I never asked why.\n\nOn my birthday, we showed you the #1 thing underneath chronic illness. That's the knife most people never see.\n\nMonday night, we show you the 4 biggest mistakes that keep pushing it deeper.\n\nMonday, September 21. 6 PM Central / 7 PM Eastern. Free. For men and women.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE MY SEAT FOR MONDAY → bpquiz.com/masterclass]\n\nJoel Polley, RN\n\nP.S. Always work alongside your doctor on your medications. Finding the cause gives you both better choices."
