   "preheader": "Live at 6 PM Central. Here's what people ask me.",
   "body": "{{first_name}},\n\nTonight at 6 PM Central / 7 PM Eastern, Annie and I go live. Here are the questions I hear most, and the false belief hiding inside each one.\n\n**\"I'm on medication. Is this still for me?\"**\nThe false belief: medication and finding the cause don't mix. They do. We teach you to work alongside your doctor, never around them.\n\n**\"I've tried everything.\"**\nThe false belief: more effort fixes it. You may have tried many things aimed at the alarm. Tonight is about what sets the alarm off.\n\n**\"It runs in my family.\"**\nThe false belief: genes decide everything. Genetics writes the recipe. Lifestyle bakes the cake.\n\n**\"This is a women's hormone thing, right?\"**\nThe false belief: men don't have hormones. Men, this one is for you too.\n\n**\"I missed Friday. Will I be lost?\"**\nNo. On Friday we showed the #1 thing underneath chronic illness. Tonight stands on its own.\n\n**\"Do I have to buy anything?\"**\nNo. The class is free. At the end, we tell you about the Change My Life Challenge for anyone who wants to go further.\n\n**The 4 Biggest Mistakes Making Your Fatigue, Blood Pressure, Weight, A1C & Hormone Symptoms Worse After 40**\nTonight. 6 PM Central / 7 PM Eastern.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE MY SEAT FOR TONIGHT → bpquiz.com/masterclass]\n\nJoel\n\nP.S. Come a few minutes early. We start on time."
