   "body": "{{first_name}},\n\nCan I brag on my husband for a minute?\n\nHis name is Joel Polley.\n\nHe's a registered nurse, like me.\n\n20 years in the ER and ICU.\n\nGirl, he has seen it all.\n\nHe's the blood pressure and blood sugar side of our house.\n\nI'm the hormone side.\n\nTomorrow is his birthday.\n\nAnd instead of a party, he said, \"I want to give people a gift.\"\n\nSo tomorrow, we're teaching one free live class together:\n\n**The #1 Thing Your Doctor Never Checks**\n\nFriday. 11 AM Central / 12 PM Eastern.\n\nHe calls it the #1 unlock. It's the only time we're doing this masterclass.\n\nAnd this one is for the men in your life too.\n\nBring your husband. Your dad. Your brother. Your friend.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE YOUR SEAT → bpquiz.com/birthday]\n\nCheering for you girl,\nEveryday Nurse Annie\n\nP.S. Don't forget to Love The Girl You're In."
