   "preheader": "Fear, courage, and two birthday gifts before sundown.",
   "body": "Joel's class today was the most powerful thing I've seen him teach. Here's his summary.\n\nAnnie\n\n---\n\n{{first_name}},\n\nIf you missed my birthday class today, here is what you missed, in two minutes.\n\nYou can watch the full replay here:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/share/v/1DApgMQkwg/\n\n**The #1 thing your doctor never checks is fear.**\n\nSome call it stress. Some call it anxiety. At the core, it's fear. And it feeds the high blood pressure, the blood sugar, and the hormone symptoms.\n\nThe goal is not to be fearless. Nobody is. The goal is courage: doing the thing even when you are afraid.\n\nEvery time you try to get healthier, fear shows up in three waves:\n\n1. **Past fears.** \"I already failed at another diet.\"\n2. **Present fears.** \"I don't have time. I don't have money. I'm taking care of everyone else.\"\n3. **Future fears.** \"What if it doesn't work? What if it gets worse?\"\n\nHere's what I told the class: **disruption always follows intention.** Always. The moment you decide to get better, the fears show up. That doesn't mean you're failing. It means you started.\n\nWhat to do about it:\n\n- Be the tortoise, not the hare. Small, steady steps beat crash diets.\n- Let where you want to be decide your next step, not where you've been.\n- Do it with people who want you to win.\n\nI also shared the hardest day of my life: the day our baby girl was born not breathing, and what fear tried to tell me in that ambulance. She is home and healthy today. That story is the reason I teach this.\n\n**Two birthday gifts before sundown:**\n\n**1. Five coaching spots at 42% off.** I turned 42 today, so I'm opening 5 spots in our 12-week coaching program with Annie and me: $7,500 → $4,350. Weekly group calls, a WhatsApp group with us, and a year in our community. This price ends at sundown tonight, 6:50 PM Central.\n\n[BUTTON: CLAIM A BIRTHDAY SPOT → bpquiz.com/allin]\n\n**2. Monday night, free.** Annie and I teach *The 4 Biggest Mistakes Making Your Fatigue, Blood Pressure, Weight, A1C & Hormone Symptoms Worse After 40.* Monday, September 21, 6 PM Central / 7 PM Eastern.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE MY MONDAY SEAT → restoreherhormones.com/masterclass]\n\nMore from this class is coming in the next few days.\n\nJoel Polley, RN\n\nP.S. Always work alongside your doctor, especially on medications."
