   "body": "{{first_name}},\n\nI took my girls to the park.\n\nThey were 4 and 6.\n\nA woman walked by. Full of energy. Glowing.\n\nMy girls watched her.\n\nAnd for days after, they played a game.\n\n\"Let's pretend she's our mommy.\"\n\nGirl, that one stung.\n\nI didn't scold them.\n\nI had to become, once again, the mom they look up to.\n\nOn Joel's birthday, we showed you the #1 thing underneath chronic illness.\n\nTomorrow night, we show you the 4 biggest mistakes that keep women stuck. And men too.\n\nMonday. 6 PM Central / 7 PM Eastern. Free.\n\nYour daughter is watching.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE MY SEAT FOR MONDAY → restoreherhormones.com/masterclass]\n\nCheering for you girl,\nEveryday Nurse Annie\n\nP.S. Bring your husband. We teach his side too."
