   "body": "{{first_name}},\n\nTonight at 6 PM Central / 7 PM Eastern, Joel and I go live.\n\nHere's what women ask me most.\n\nAnd the lie hiding inside each question.\n\n**\"Isn't this just aging?\"**\nThe lie: tired and moody is your new normal. Your body is sending signals. We teach you to read them.\n\n**\"I'm on medication. Can I still come?\"**\nThe lie: it's pills or nothing. You work alongside your doctor. Always.\n\n**\"I've tried every diet.\"**\nThe lie: you need more willpower. You need to know what's underneath.\n\n**\"Is it only for women?\"**\nThe lie: men don't have hormones. Bring him. His numbers are talking too.\n\n**\"I missed Friday.\"**\nThe lie: you're behind. Tonight stands on its own.\n\n**\"Do I have to buy something?\"**\nNo. It's free. At the end, we share the Change My Life Challenge for anyone who wants more.\n\n**The 4 Biggest Mistakes Making Your Fatigue, Blood Pressure, Weight, A1C & Hormone Symptoms Worse After 40**\nTonight. 6 PM Central / 7 PM Eastern.\n\n[BUTTON: SAVE MY SEAT FOR TONIGHT → restoreherhormones.com/masterclass]\n\nEveryday Nurse Annie\n\nP.S. Come as you are, girl."
